---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import ProcessFlow from "../components/ProcessFlow.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Wayne Omni is a Malaysia-based marketing agency connecting strategy, creative, media and technology.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Wayne Omni · Malaysia" title="One agency. The whole journey." intro="Wayne Omni is a Malaysia-based marketing agency, registered as Wayne Omnipotent. We connect web development, acquisition, content and automation into one practice." />
  <section class="about-grid">
    <div>
      <h2>Built for businesses that have outgrown disconnected execution.</h2>
      <figure class="about-portrait" data-reveal="clip-up">
        <div class="about-portrait-frame"><img src="/images/wayne-portrait.webp" width="850" height="1063" alt="Wayne, founder of Wayne Omni" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <figcaption>Wayne · Founder, Wayne Omni</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>Many businesses do not have a channel problem. They have a handoff problem: the ad makes one promise, the page tells another story, the form lacks context and the follow-up arrives too late.</p>
      <p>Wayne Omni works across that whole path. The practice covers website development, landing pages, Meta, Google, TikTok and LinkedIn advertising, Facebook, Instagram and Redbook content, email marketing, CRM workflows and measurement.</p>
      <p>The goal is not to add complexity. It is to make the customer journey clearer and the marketing operation easier to improve.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section dark-section">
    <span class="eyebrow light">A connected practice</span>
    <h2 class="large-section-title">From first glance to the next big decision.</h2>
    <ProcessFlow dark />
  </section>
  <section class="language-band">
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>English</strong></div>
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>中文</strong></div>
    <div><span>Campaign language</span><strong>Bahasa Melayu</strong></div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand growthCheck />
</BaseLayout>
